AO Foundation. AO Surgery Reference. English.

[Authorized source](https://www.aofoundation.org/our-services-and-resources/ao-surgery-reference).

The official introduction links fracture-management material, including clavicle, scapula, and proximal humerus regions. Follow the relevant anatomical region for advanced study. Professional procedural content supplies context and evidence questions; it does not authorize unsupervised reduction, immobilization decisions, or surgery.

**Access and reuse:** AO describes free access to orthopedic trauma and spine sections. Other sections may have membership conditions. Free access does not grant unrestricted redistribution of the site; preserve its image and content terms. No material is bundled.

